5,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,Hello everyone. Let us have a calm discussion to find the werewolf.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,I agree. Logic and observation will be our best tools here.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Rin,,Yay! A mystery game! I'm gonna find the bad guy first!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Misaki,,Let's just stay focused.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,A delightful start. I trust we can all maintain our composure while we unravel this little puzzle.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
