11,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,Does anyone have a strategy for the first few days?,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Rin,,Maybe we can ask everyone their favorite color! The werewolf might get nervous!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"That wouldn't be very helpful, Rin.","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"While Rin's enthusiasm is charming, I believe we should focus on behavioral inconsistencies instead.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,I think observing how people react to each other is a good approach.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,Exactly. I'll be watching for any contradictions in your statements.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Rin,,I'm watching too! My eyes are like a hawk! *stretches arms*,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
