31,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,Good morning. I hope everyone slept peacefully.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I did. Now, if the Seer has any information, they might want to consider how to reveal it.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Rin,,Did anyone see anything spooky last night? I had a dream about a giant cookie!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"It's too early for cookies, Rin.","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed. I wonder if our Seer has found a thread to pull on, or if they are playing it safe.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I believe it is better to be cautious. A premature reveal can be dangerous.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"True, but silence can also be misinterpreted as suspicion. @Jonathan, you seem very cautious.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Rin,,"Ooh, is Jonathan the werewolf? He's being all mysterious!","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"That's a leap, Rin. Let's not rush to conclusions.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"A leap indeed. Though, I must admit, the tension is starting to become quite exquisite.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I am simply valuing the peace of the group. I don't wish to cause unnecessary panic.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Peace is fine, but we need results. If no one claims Seer, we might have to guess based on behavior.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Rin,,"I don't like guessing! I want a clue! @Misaki, you're being too quiet!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I'm just thinking. I don't see any obvious lies yet.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,Silence can be a shield or a sanctuary. I find Misaki's restraint rather refreshing.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I think we should look at who is trying to push the vote too quickly.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"I'm not pushing, I'm analyzing. But since we must vote, I'll keep an eye on the most erratic.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Rin,,"I'm not erratic! I'm just excited! I vote for the person who looks the most ""wolfy""!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Misaki,,That's not a logical criterion.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Logic is a fickle thing in a room full of strangers. I shall cast my vote with a heavy heart.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
