64,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"This is tragic. We lost Rin, and Benjamin has been taken from us.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,It's a heavy loss. The werewolf is efficient. We are now down to three people.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,2,1,talk,Misaki,,We need to be very careful now. The balance of power has shifted.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I can no longer remain silent. @Mizuki, I know who you are. You are the werewolf.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"That's a bold claim, Jonathan. Do you have proof, or are you just guessing to save yourself?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"Jonathan, are you the Seer?","{""words"":5,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
