71,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,A classic bluff. The werewolf often claims to be the Seer once the numbers dwindle to create panic.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"If Jonathan is lying, he's risking everything on a single vote.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
